OL,3,GNEWSAFallen trees cause 'significant
OL,4,Adamage' to railway
OL,5,
OL,6,FFallen trees have caused severe
OL,7,Fdisruption to rail services in the East
OL,8,Fof England, with people advised to
OL,9,Favoid travelling by train on three
OL,10,Froutes until Sunday.
OL,12,FGreater Anglia said "significant
OL,13,Fdamage" to overhead line equipment had
OL,14,Fcancelled services between Colchester
OL,15,Fand Ipswich, Bishop's Stortford and
OL,16,FStansted Airport, and Manningtree to
OL,17,FHarwich Town.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the operator said:
OL,20,F"Network Rail response teams are on
OL,21,Fsite, with work to repair the damage
OL,22,Fexpected to take all day."
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
