OL,3,GNEWSAFallen trees cause 'significant
OL,4,Adamage' to railway
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriday night's high winds also cut
OL,7,Fpower to about 2,500 properties around
OL,8,FBury St Edmunds, Suffolk, when a
OL,9,Fhigh-voltage line was damaged, but UK
OL,10,FPower Networks said most had been
OL,11,Freconnected overnight.
